# Cloudflare Turnstile site key (the public one) for the contact form bot challenge.
# Get it at https://dash.cloudflare.com/?to=/:account/turnstile — free, no credit card.
# The matching secret key goes in the Formspree form settings, not here.
# If this is left empty the form still works, just without the challenge.
NEXT_PUBLIC_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY=
